---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { lessons } from '../../../../worker/learning';
const intro = 'BuildScope 100｜#009：Dewatering 做緊乜？地下水點解可以影響成個工程？';
---
<BaseLayout title={`${intro}｜工程白話文 BuildScope`} description="Dewatering 微課程試行版：由地下水、水壓到開挖穩定及周邊沉降，以工程白話理解施工風險。" noindex>
  <section class="learn-hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">BUILDSCOPE LEARNING CENTRE / MICRO COURSE 009</p>
        <h1>地下水抽走咗，<br /><em>工程就安全？</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">BuildScope 100｜#009 Dewatering<br />由地下水、Wellpoint、Deep Well 到孔隙水壓，理解開挖、周邊沉降與施工進度嘅關係。</p>
        <div class="course-meta"><span>🚇 Civil & Infrastructure</span><span>入門 / Cross-discipline</span><span>約 15–20 分鐘</span><span>會員課程</span></div><a class="start" href="#course-reader">探索課程 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="cover" aria-label="Dewatering 抽水井及地下水示意圖"><div class="cover-label">BS / 100 <span>009</span></div><div class="water-diagram" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ground-line"></div><div class="water-line"></div><div class="well"></div><div class="drawdown"></div><div class="soil"></div></div><div class="cover-foot">DEWATERING<br />GROUNDWATER / PRESSURE / MOVEMENT</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="course-section container" id="course-reader">
    <div class="section-intro"><span>01 / COURSE PATH</span><h2>由一個問題，逐步拆解施工邏輯。</h2><p>課程仍在整理來源素材。以下是依照 Skool 次序建立的學習框架；未核實的標題及課堂均有明確標示。</p></div>
    <div class="learning-shell">
      <aside class="lesson-panel" id="lesson-panel"><div class="panel-top"><strong>課程目錄</strong><span id="progress-label">0 / 9</span></div><div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="學習進度" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="9" aria-valuenow="0"><div id="progress-fill"></div></div>
        <nav aria-label="課堂目錄" id="lesson-nav">{lessons.map(([id,title],index)=><button type="button" class="lesson-item" data-lesson={id} aria-current={index===0?'step':undefined}><span class="lesson-index">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>{title}</span><small aria-label="未開放">↗</small></button>)}</nav>
      </aside>
      <article class="reader" aria-live="polite"><div class="reader-top"><span id="reader-count">LESSON 01 / 09</span><span class="status">內容待核對</span></div><div class="reader-body"><p class="kicker">BUILDSCOPE 100 / PILOT 009</p><h2 id="reader-title">{lessons[0][1]}</h2><div class="placeholder-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div><h3>課堂原始內容尚未匯入</h3><p>六節文字已收到；課堂仍在編審及安全匯入階段。第三方圖片未確認授權，建議 Checklist 亦尚未製作。完成後先開放閱讀。</p><div id="lesson-content" hidden></div><div class="locked" id="locked-message"><strong>會員課堂預覽</strong><span id="access-message">註冊或登入後，可查看自己的權限狀態。現階段所有課堂仍未發布。</span></div></div><div class="reader-actions"><button type="button" id="prev" disabled>← 上一節</button><button type="button" id="complete" disabled title="課堂尚未發布">標記完成</button><button type="button" id="next">下一節 →</button></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="concepts container"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHY IT MATTERS</p><h2>有 Retaining Wall，點解仲要抽水？</h2><p>Excavation Level 低過地下水位時，水可能由坑側或坑底進入；亦可能喺坑底形成向上水壓。地下水控制要同圍護結構、施工次序及監測數據一齊睇。</p></div><div class="concept-grid"><div><strong>01</strong><h3>控制水位與水壓</h3><p>分清地表積水排走同地下水控制。</p></div><div><strong>02</strong><h3>觀察地層反應</h3><p>比較 Groundwater、Settlement 與 Wall Movement 趨勢。</p></div><div><strong>03</strong><h3>記錄工程影響</h3><p>用施工、指示和同期紀錄判斷工期與成本風險。</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="membership"><div class="container member-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / MEMBERSHIP</p><h2>一個網站帳戶，<br />預備你嘅學習路徑。</h2><p>現有 Skool 付費會員毋須重複付款。建立網站帳戶後，可由管理員核對會員資格並批出等值課程權限。兩邊訂閱狀態不會自動同步。</p><p class="member-state" id="member-state">正在檢查登入狀態…</p><button id="logout" class="outline" hidden>登出</button><button id="portal" class="outline" hidden>管理測試訂閱</button></div><div class="account-card"><div class="tabs"><button class="active" data-mode="register">建立帳戶</button><button data-mode="login">登入</button></div><form id="account-form"><label>電郵地址<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" /></label><label>密碼（至少 12 字元）<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" required autocomplete="new-password" /></label><button class="submit" type="submit">建立網站帳戶 →</button><p id="form-message" role="status"></p></form><div class="billing"><strong>Stripe Test Mode</strong><p>月費及年費待設定，價格尚未獲確認。現階段不會收取真實款項。</p><button id="monthly" disabled>測試月費訂閱</button><button id="annual" disabled>測試年費訂閱</button></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="container closing"><span>BUILD SCOPE / FROM SITE TO SMARTER WORK</span><h2>從地盤問題開始，<br />學得更有方法。</h2><a href="https://www.skool.com/buildscope-learning-lab-1916" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">返回 BuildScope Learning Lab ↗</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  const ids = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-lesson]'));
  let selected = 0, mode = 'register', access = false;
  let published = new Set<string>(), completed = new Set<string>();
  const $ = (id:string) => document.getElementById(id)!;
  function render() {
    ids.forEach((button,index)=>{button.classList.toggle('selected',index===selected);if(index===selected) button.setAttribute('aria-current','step');else button.removeAttribute('aria-current')});
    $('reader-title').textContent = ids[selected].querySelector('span:nth-child(2)')?.textContent||'';
    $('reader-count').textContent = `LESSON ${String(selected+1).padStart(2,'0')} / ${String(ids.length).padStart(2,'0')}`;
    (document.getElementById('prev') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = selected===0;
    (document.getElementById('next') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = selected===ids.length-1;
    history.replaceState(null,'',selected===0?'#course-reader':`#${ids[selected].dataset.lesson}`);
    loadLesson();
    if (matchMedia('(max-width: 850px)').matches) $('reader-title').scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'smooth'});
  }
  ids.forEach((button,index)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{selected=index;render()}));
  $('prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{selected--;render()});$('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{selected++;render()});
  const initial=ids.findIndex(x=>location.hash===`#${x.dataset.lesson}`);if(initial>=0){selected=initial;render()}else ids[0].classList.add('selected');
  async function api(path:string, data?:object) {const response=await fetch(`/api/learn/${path}`,{method:data?'POST':'GET',credentials:'same-origin',headers:data?{'Content-Type':'application/json'}:{},body:data?JSON.stringify(data):undefined});return {status:response.status, data:await response.json() as { [key:string]:any }}}
  async function loadLesson(){const button=ids[selected], key=button.dataset.lesson!;const content=$('lesson-content'), locked=$('locked-message'), complete=document.getElementById('complete') as HTMLButtonElement;content.hidden=true;locked.hidden=false;complete.disabled=true;if(!access||!published.has(key))return;const result=await api(`lesson?id=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`);if(button!==ids[selected]||result.status!==200)return;content.textContent=result.data.body;content.hidden=false;locked.hidden=true;complete.disabled=completed.has(key)}
  async function refresh(){try{const {data}=await api('me');access=Boolean(data.access);const listing=await api('lessons');published=new Set(listing.data.lessons?.filter((x:{ready:boolean})=>x.ready).map((x:{id:string})=>x.id)||[]);completed=new Set(listing.data.lessons?.filter((x:{completed:boolean})=>x.completed).map((x:{id:string})=>x.id)||[]);$('progress-label').textContent=`${completed.size} / ${ids.length}`;($('progress-fill') as HTMLElement).style.width=`${100*completed.size/ids.length}%`;document.querySelector('.progress-track')?.setAttribute('aria-valuenow',String(completed.size));loadLesson();$('member-state').textContent=data.member?`${data.member.email}｜${data.access?'已開通課程權限':'未開通課程權限'}`:'尚未登入網站帳戶';$('access-message').textContent=data.access?'你已有權限。課堂內容尚待編審匯入。':'登入後可檢查權限。現有 Skool 會員可向管理員申請驗證。';$('logout').hidden=!data.member;$('portal').hidden=!data.member;const enabled=Boolean(data.member&&data.billingConfigured&&!data.access);for(const id of ['monthly','annual'])(document.getElementById(id) as HTMLButtonElement).disabled=!enabled;}catch{$('member-state').textContent='會員服務尚未設定；課程預覽仍可瀏覽。'}}
  refresh();
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-mode]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{mode=button.dataset.mode||'register';document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===button));document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.submit')!.textContent=mode==='login'?'登入 →':'建立網站帳戶 →';document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name=password]')!.autocomplete=mode==='login'?'current-password':'new-password'}));
  $('account-form').addEventListener('submit',async event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement, values=new FormData(form);const result=await api(mode,{email:values.get('email'),password:values.get('password')});$('form-message').textContent=result.data.error||'完成，請查看會員狀態。';if(result.status===200){form.reset();refresh()}});
  $('complete').addEventListener('click',async()=>{const id=ids[selected].dataset.lesson;const result=await api('progress',{id});if(result.status===200)refresh()});
  $('logout').addEventListener('click',async()=>{await api('logout',{});refresh()});
  for (const [id,interval] of [['monthly','monthly'],['annual','annual']]) $(id).addEventListener('click',async()=>{const {data}=await api('checkout',{interval});if(data.url)location.href=data.url;else $('form-message').textContent=data.error});
  $('portal').addEventListener('click',async()=>{const {data}=await api('billing-portal',{});if(data.url)location.href=data.url;else $('form-message').textContent=data.error});
</script>
<style>
  .learn-hero{background:#101923;color:white;overflow:hidden}.hero-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:6vw;align-items:center;min-height:620px;padding-block:80px}.eyebrow,.section-intro span,.kicker,.closing span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#f97316}.learn-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.1rem,7vw,6.8rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:26px 0}.learn-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff8a43}.hero-copy{color:#cbd5e1;font-size:1.08rem;max-width:540px}.start{display:inline-flex;background:#f97316;padding:14px 24px;margin-top:25px;font-weight:900;gap:40px}.cover{position:relative;height:440px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 70%,#1e4661,#183044 55%,#263642);border:1px solid #5d7889;box-shadow:22px 22px 0 #f97316;overflow:hidden}.cover-label{position:absolute;top:25px;left:28px;right:28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.2em}.cover-label span{color:#f97316}.bore{position:absolute;top:95px;left:30%;width:40%;height:380px;background:#171e21;border:22px solid #b3a897;border-bottom:0;transform:perspective(600px) rotateX(10deg)}.casing{position:absolute;inset:0;border-inline:10px solid #c6cdd0}.steel{position:absolute;left:35%;width:30%;height:100%;border:7px solid #ff8447;border-block:0;z-index:1}.fluid{position:absolute;inset:25% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(#628f89aa,#367c8f)}.cover-foot{position:absolute;bottom:25px;left:28px;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800}.course-section{padding-block:100px}.section-intro{max-width:780px;margin-bottom:42px}.section-intro h2,.membership h2,.closing h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.23;letter-spacing:-.05em}.section-intro p{color:#52525b}.learning-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px minmax(0,1fr);border:1px solid #e4e4e7;box-shadow:0 18px 45px #1111110a}.lesson-panel{background:#f7f7f5;border-right:1px solid #e4e4e7}.panel-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 22px 12px}.panel-top span{font-size:.8rem;color:#71717a}.progress-track{height:5px;background:#ddd;margin:0 22px 18px}.progress-track div{width:0;background:#f97316;height:100%}.lesson-item{width:100%;display:flex;gap:13px;text-align:left;align-items:flex-start;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e7;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5}.lesson-item:hover,.lesson-item.selected{background:white}.lesson-item.selected{border-left:4px solid #f97316;padding-left:14px;font-weight:800}.lesson-index{color:#f97316;font-weight:900}.lesson-item span:nth-child(2){flex:1}.lesson-item small{color:#999}.reader{min-width:0}.reader-top,.reader-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:22px 30px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e4e7;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.status{color:#a55116;background:#fff0e5;padding:5px 10px}.reader-body{max-width:720px;margin:auto;padding:70px 48px 90px;min-height:570px}.reader-body h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.7rem);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.04em}.placeholder-icon{width:72px;height:72px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #f97316;color:#f97316;border-radius:50%;font-size:2rem;margin:55px 0 18px}.reader-body h3{font-size:1.3rem}.reader-body p{color:#555}.locked{border-left:3px solid #f97316;background:#f8fafc;padding:18px 22px;margin-top:35px;display:grid;gap:5px}.locked span{color:#555;font-size:.86rem}.reader-actions{border-top:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-bottom:0;letter-spacing:0}.reader-actions button,.outline{background:white;border:1px solid #ccc;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer}.reader-actions button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.membership{background:#f7f7f5;padding:100px 0}.member-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 440px;gap:8vw}.member-grid p{max-width:540px;color:#555}.member-state{border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding-top:20px;font-weight:800}.account-card{background:white;border:1px solid #ddd;box-shadow:14px 14px 0 #e5e7eb;padding:28px}.tabs{display:flex;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}.tabs button{border:0;background:none;padding:0 0 14px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;color:#666}.tabs button.active{color:#f97316;border-bottom:3px solid #f97316}form label{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:22px;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:800}form input{padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;width:100%;border-radius:4px}form .submit{width:100%;border:0;background:#101923;color:white;padding:13px;margin-top:25px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}#form-message{min-height:22px;color:#b45309;font-size:.85rem}.billing{border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px}.billing p{font-size:.85rem}.billing button{padding:10px;margin:5px;border:1px solid #bbb;background:white}.billing button:disabled{opacity:.5}.closing{padding-block:100px}.closing a{color:#d6500b;font-weight:900}@media(max-width:850px){.hero-inner,.member-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-inner{padding-block:60px;gap:60px}.cover{max-width:520px}.learning-shell{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.lesson-panel{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}.lesson-panel nav{max-height:240px;overflow:auto}.reader-body{min-height:460px;padding:45px 24px 65px}.reader-top,.reader-actions{padding:18px}.course-section,.membership,.closing{padding-block:60px}.member-grid{gap:40px}}@media(max-width:480px){.cover{height:330px;box-shadow:10px 10px 0 #f97316}.learn-hero h1{font-size:3rem}.reader-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}.reader-actions button{font-size:.75rem;padding:9px}.account-card{padding:20px}}
</style>

<style>.water-diagram{position:absolute;inset:100px 25px 80px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#9b805b55 0 2px,transparent 2px 21px)}.ground-line{position:absolute;top:15%;width:100%;border-top:4px solid #d8c7a4}.water-line{position:absolute;top:33%;left:0;width:100%;border-top:3px dashed #63bfcd}.well{position:absolute;top:7%;height:95%;left:47%;width:7%;background:#e8e8e7;border:4px solid #ef7944;z-index:2}.drawdown{position:absolute;top:34%;left:12%;width:76%;height:45%;border:4px solid #64bccd;border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 50% 50%;z-index:1}.soil{position:absolute;bottom:0;width:100%;height:25%;background:#81684b55}#lesson-content{white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.85;color:#292e37;font-size:1rem;margin-top:35px}</style>

<style>.course-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:25px 0 4px}.course-meta span{border:1px solid #516579;border-radius:3px;padding:6px 10px;color:#e9eef1;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:800}.concepts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5vw;padding-block:70px 100px}.concepts h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3.3rem);line-height:1.22}.concepts p{color:#555}.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:start}.concept-grid div{border-top:3px solid #f97316;padding:14px;background:#f7f7f5;min-height:230px}.concept-grid strong{color:#e35d12}.concept-grid h3{font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.3}.concept-grid p{font-size:.82rem}@media(max-width:900px){.concepts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.concept-grid div{min-height:0}}</style>
